{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Receiving credentials","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and look after them once they’re held."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Receiving credentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"],"anchor":"Receiving-credentials"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer offers credentials with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a QR code or a link the holder opens. Register the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so links"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open the app, and hand the link to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolves the offer and the issuer’s metadata, and returns an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you show the holder: who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offering what."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The offer names one of two grants:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Authorization code:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the holder signs in at the issuer’s pages, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a browser, which redirects back to the wallet’s redirect URI."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pre-authorized code:","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the issuer has already authenticated the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder, and may ask for a PIN it sent them separately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer\/txCode-swift.property"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Either way, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" then requests, checks and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores the credentials, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends the issuance."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Receive-an-offer","text":"Receive an offer"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import AuthenticationServices","import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Receives the credentials an offer link offers. `askPIN` asks the","\/\/\/ holder for the PIN the issuer sent, or returns nil if they cancel;","\/\/\/ `signIn` opens the issuer's page and returns the redirect back.","func receive(offerLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             askPIN: (Offer.TxCode?) async -> String?,","             signIn: (URL) async throws -> URL) async throws -> Issuance.Result? {","    let issuance = try await wallet.startIssuance(offer: offerLink)","    switch issuance.offer.grant {","    case .preAuthorizedCode:","        while true {","            guard let pin = await askPIN(issuance.offer.txCode) else {","                try await issuance.close()","                return nil","            }","            do {","                try await issuance.redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin: pin)","                break","            } catch let error as WalletError where error.isRetryable {","                continue \/\/ A wrong PIN (invalid_grant): ask again.","            }","        }","    case .authorizationCode:","        let url = try await issuance.beginAuthorization()","        let redirect = try await signIn(url)","        try await issuance.completeAuthorization(redirect: redirect)","    }","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/Result","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" lists what arrived, what the issuer deferred, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what failed: one credential the issuer refused doesn’t hold up the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"rest."}]},{"level":3,"text":"Open the issuer’s page","anchor":"Open-the-issuers-page","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Open the authorization URL in an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession"},{"text":", with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redirect URI’s scheme as its callback scheme. An ephemeral session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps the issuer’s cookies out of Safari’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Opens issuers' authorization pages over `window`.","@MainActor","final class IssuerSignIn: NSObject, ASWebAuthenticationPresentationContextProviding {","    private let window: ASPresentationAnchor","    private let callbackScheme: String","","    init(window: ASPresentationAnchor, callbackScheme: String) {","        self.window = window","        self.callbackScheme = callbackScheme","    }","","    nonisolated func presentationAnchor(for session: ASWebAuthenticationSession) -> ASPresentationAnchor {","        MainActor.assumeIsolated { window }","    }","","    \/\/\/ The issuer's redirect back, or `ASWebAuthenticationSessionError`","    \/\/\/ `.canceledLogin` when the holder closes the page.","    func open(_ url: URL) async throws -> URL {","        try await withCheckedThrowingContinuation { continuation in","            let session = ASWebAuthenticationSession(url: url, callbackURLScheme: callbackScheme) { redirect, error in","                if let redirect {","                    continuation.resume(returning: redirect)","                } else {","                    continuation.resume(throwing: error ?? URLError(.unknown))","                }","            }","            session.presentationContextProvider = self","            session.prefersEphemeralWebBrowserSession = true","            session.start()","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the holder closes the page, the offer stays open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can begin again. A redirect is used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up by "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whatever happens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so after a failure there, begin again rather than retrying it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Resume after the app is killed","anchor":"Resume-after-the-app-is-killed","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS can terminate the app while the holder is at the issuer’s pages.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The authorization in progress is kept in the credential store, so when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the redirect arrives at a relaunched app, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"completes it and returns an issuance ready for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". Handle every redirect this way: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI, from ","type":"text"},{"code":"onOpenURL","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/\/ Completes an authorization the app was killed during, from the","\/\/\/ redirect iOS delivers to the relaunched app.","func resume(redirect: URL, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> Issuance.Result {","    let issuance = try await wallet.resumeIssuance(redirect: redirect)","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A redirect that matches no authorization in progress throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Wait for a deferred credential","anchor":"Wait-for-a-deferred-credential","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer may issue a credential later, after a review, say. It’s kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned, so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"survives the app quitting. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists them"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without network requests; poll each at the interval the issuer asks for."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/\/ Polls a deferred credential until the issuer settles it: the","\/\/\/ credential, or a `.credentialDenied` error.","func waitFor(_ deferred: DeferredCredential, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> CredentialSummary {","    var interval = deferred.intervalSeconds","    while true {","        try await Task.sleep(for: .seconds(max(interval, 5)))","        switch try await wallet.pollDeferred(id: deferred.id) {","        case .issued(let credential): return credential","        case .pending(let next): interval = next","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" gives one up, deleting its keys: once","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its access token has expired, say (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Look after held credentials","anchor":"Look-after-held-credentials","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" lists them, and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"returns one with its claims, for display. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries the issuer’s names, logos and colours, in the holder’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" checks revocation against the issuer’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"status list, which covers many credentials, so the issuer can’t tell","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which one is checked.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each credential arrives as a batch of copies, each bound to its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize"},{"type":"text","text":"), so presentations can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linked by the credential. When "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches zero, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" replaces them without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder, if the issuance kept a refresh token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","isActive":true},{"text":"). Otherwise it throws","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": receive the credential again."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" deletes a credential and its keys,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"revoking its refresh token at the issuer."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/checkStatus(id:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/checkstatus(id:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","title":"checkStatus(id:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"checkStatus"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialSummaryV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CredentialSummary"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetches the issuer’s status list for a credential, checks its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signature, and returns the credential with its revocation status"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recorded. The list covers many credentials, so fetching it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t tell the issuer which one is checked. A credential without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a status list is returned as it is."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/locales":{"title":"locales","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"locales"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The holder’s preferred languages (BCP 47, most preferred first),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for issuers’ display metadata. ","type":"text"},{"code":"Locale.preferredLanguages","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"usual choice.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/locales","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/DeferredCredential/accessTokenExpiresAt":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessTokenExpiresAt"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"When the access token it’s polled with expires, if the issuer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"said: after it, polls fail and it can only be abandoned."}],"type":"topic","title":"accessTokenExpiresAt","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/deferredcredential\/accesstokenexpiresat","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/reissueRequired":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","title":"reissueRequired","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/reissuerequired","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential can’t be refreshed: no refresh token was kept, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Authorization Server no longer accepts it. Receive it again"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from a new offer."}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reissueRequired","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Offer":{"abstract":[{"text":"What a Credential Offer offers.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Offer"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/offer","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Offer"}],"title":"Offer","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/close()":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()","title":"close()","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/close()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Ends the issuance, deleting its keys but those its deferred"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials still poll with."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"close","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/display":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/display","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How to show it, from the issuer’s metadata when it was received."}],"title":"display","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"display"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialDisplayV","text":"CredentialDisplay"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/deferredCredentials()":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/deferredcredentials()","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","title":"deferredCredentials()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"deferredCredentials"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet18DeferredCredentialV","text":"DeferredCredential"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The credentials issuers have deferred and not yet settled, oldest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first — including ones from before the app last quit. Makes no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network calls: poll each at its interval."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/completeAuthorization(redirect:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)","title":"completeAuthorization(redirect:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/completeauthorization(redirect:)","abstract":[{"text":"Completes the authorization with the issuer’s redirect back. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redirect is used up whatever happens: if this fails — the token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request didn’t get through, say — call ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"beginAuthorization()"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again, rather than retrying this.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completeAuthorization","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"redirect","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/batchSize":{"title":"batchSize","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchSize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"How many copies of each credential to request when an issuer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offers batches, each bound to its own key, so each presentation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can use one no Verifier has seen. 0 means the SDK’s default (5);","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s capped at the issuer’s batch size.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/batchsize","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/requestCredentials()":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/requestcredentials()","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","title":"requestCredentials()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestCredentials","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind